# App image (preditr.dockerfile: COPY . /app) should carry only the running app.
# Genome/annotation/maps ship in the per-organism preditr-ref images (built in the
# separate preditr_ref repo) and are read at runtime from PREDITR_REFERENCES_PATH;
# deploy tooling (run/) is not needed in the app image.
#
# maps/ and references/ are kept here defensively: they normally live in the
# preditr_ref repo, but a local dev checkout may sync maps/ and it must stay out of
# the image.
#
# www/docs/ holds README screenshots. The rest of www/ is served by the Shiny app,
# but those images are only rendered on GitHub, so they stay out of the image.
#
# local/ holds benchmark inputs and HPC job scripts. No app code reads it, and it
# accounted for 48 MB of the 51 MB /app carried through 1.10.0.

maps/
references/
run/
www/docs/
local/
.git/
.claude/
**/.DS_Store
